<div class="methodology">
  <p>
    Medium pays members based on reading time from paying subscribers. The base
    rate is approximately <strong>$0.01–$0.04 per member read-minute</strong>.
    This calculator uses ~$0.025 as the base rate, scaled by your member ratio,
    read depth (longer isn't always better — most readers bail after 4–5 min),
    follower amplification, and a bonus multiplier representing curation/boost
    eligibility.
  </p>
  <p>
    Estimates are illustrative. Actual earnings vary significantly based on
    topic, distribution, curation, and seasonal Partner Program fluctuations.
    Writers in high-demand topics (tech, self-improvement, productivity)
    generally earn at the higher end.
  </p>
</div>
